183
00:12:23,760 --> 00:12:27,760
I went into a violent and uncontrollable rage.

184
00:12:27,760 --> 00:12:30,760
One that boiled from the pit of my stomach.

185
00:12:30,760 --> 00:12:33,760
It came to me naturally.

186
00:12:33,760 --> 00:12:39,760
And while I can't remember exactly what happened next, I still hear that roar.

187
00:12:39,760 --> 00:12:40,760
Even now.

188
00:12:40,760 --> 00:12:44,760
I can't believe a sound like that came from my throat.

189
00:12:44,760 --> 00:12:45,760
From my own mouth.

190
00:12:45,760 --> 00:12:59,760
Before I knew it, the demon was on the brink of death.

191
00:12:59,760 --> 00:13:03,760
But apparently, it couldn't die even with its head smashed in.

192
00:13:03,760 --> 00:13:16,760
So it was suffering.

193
00:13:16,760 --> 00:13:18,760
Soon after, the sun began to rise.

194
00:13:18,760 --> 00:13:21,760
And the demon turned to dust and vanished.

195
00:13:21,760 --> 00:13:24,760
But I couldn't care less about that.

196
00:13:29,760 --> 00:13:33,760
All I wanted was to get to Uichiro and tend to his wounds.

197
00:13:33,760 --> 00:13:37,760
But suddenly, my body felt like it was heavier than lead.

198
00:13:37,760 --> 00:13:40,760
It took me what felt like ages.

199
