Right.

250
00:16:05,760 --> 00:16:06,760
Damn swordsmith.

251
00:16:06,760 --> 00:16:07,760
Damn Philistine.

252
00:16:07,760 --> 00:16:08,760
His focus is absurd.

253
00:16:08,760 --> 00:16:09,760
It's practically inhuman.

254
00:16:09,760 --> 00:16:20,760
Even after all I've done to him, he still won't stop honing that damn sword.

255
00:16:21,760 --> 00:16:26,760
Even when I decimated one of his eyes, he maintained his focus sharpening that sword.

256
00:16:26,760 --> 00:16:27,760
Ooh, I know.

257
00:16:31,760 --> 00:16:34,760
What if I tell him I'm going to kill this one?

258
00:16:39,760 --> 00:16:43,760
He managed to escape the water prison pot, but how is that possible?

259
00:16:44,760 --> 00:16:45,760
It shouldn't be.

260
00:16:45,760 --> 00:16:50,760
I was so certain that his death was imminent that he was the furthest thing from my mind.

261
00:16:51,760 --> 00:16:53,760
No, wait a second.

262
00:16:53,760 --> 00:16:58,760
On the other hand, I didn't notice he escaped because I was so focused on dealing with these two.

263
00:16:58,760 --> 00:16:59,760
Yes!

264
00:17:00,760 --> 00:17:01,760
Hmm?

265
00:17:01,760 --> 00:17:02,760
Hold on, hold on, hold on.

266
00:17:02,760 --> 00:17:04,760
What's with that mark on his face?

267
00:17:05,760 --> 00:17:12,760
If I recall the information Lord Muzan gave me, the child with the earrings is the one who has the mark on his face, isn't he?

268
00:17:13,760 --> 00:17:14,760
No, no, no.

269
00:17:14,760 --> 00:17:15,760
It matters not.

270
00:17:15,760 --> 00:17:17,760
How are you standing there so nonchalantly?

271
00:17:18,760 --> 00:17:22,760
The attack I landed on you earlier should have left your body completely paralyzed.

272
00:17:23,760 --> 00:17:28,760
And how are you able to summon even greater speed than our last encounter and wound me?

273
00:17:31,760 --> 00:17:32,760
Octopus face hell!

274
00:17:34,760 --> 00:17:35,760
More koki-dok-dok!

275
00:17:40,760 --> 00:17:41,760
Yoo-hoo!

276
00:17:41,760 --> 00:17:44,760
You didn't expect this octopus flesh to be so springy.

277
00:17:44,760 --> 00:17:46,760
Let's see you try and slash this.

278
00:17:46,760 --> 00:17:48,760
He's still honing that sword. Is he a fool? Surely he's not in his right mind.

279
00:17:48,760 --> 00:17:54,760
His madness is sublime! The swordsmith can wait until I've killed off the Hashira.

