N-no! It was nothing! All I did was follow the instructions your first swordsmith left me!

287
00:18:40,760 --> 00:18:49,760
That's right. It was Mr. Tetsuido who forged my first sword for me, wasn't it? But he's since passed away from heart disease.

288
00:18:49,760 --> 00:18:55,760
Hm! No matter how many times you replace your sword, it won't change a thing.

289
00:19:00,760 --> 00:19:03,760
Ah, it fits like a glove.

290
00:19:03,760 --> 00:19:15,760
I worry about you very much, boy. After all, who could ever understand what it is you're going through?

291
00:19:15,760 --> 00:19:22,760
How you only have time for battle and training. How you're barely getting by and have no breathing room.

292
00:19:22,760 --> 00:19:26,760
How anxious you must be all the time because you can't seem to remember anything.

293
00:19:27,760 --> 00:19:30,760
And how you strive so hard you end up vomiting blood.

294
00:19:31,760 --> 00:19:33,760
Who could ever understand something like that?

295
00:19:34,760 --> 00:19:39,760
Whenever I lay eyes on the battered swords you've used, it brings a tear to my eye.

296
00:19:39,760 --> 00:19:52,760
Muichiro, listen to me carefully. I feel I won't be around much longer. But I'll still worry about you, even in the afterlife.

297
00:19:52,760 --> 00:20:05,760
Mr. Tetsuido, I'm sorry. I know I made you worry, but I'm alright now. So, rest easy.

298
00:20:06,760 --> 00:20:11,760
Misbreathing. Fifth fork. Sea of clouds and haze!

299
00:20:11,760 --> 00:20:23,760
Your rapid fire chopping had me worried, but it seems like you're not able to keep up with my vase's speed after all.

300
00:20:24,760 --> 00:20:25,760
Are you sure?

301
00:20:25,760 --> 00:20:26,760
What?

302
00:20:27,760 --> 00:20:32,760
Maybe it's because you've lived for hundreds of years, but your senses have grown weary.

303
00:20:32,760 --> 00:20:41,760
I'm going to behead you. I've got much more important things to do than playing with that silly vase of yours.

304
00:20:42,760 --> 00:20:45,760
Don't underestimate me, you damn brat.

305
00:20:53,760 --> 00:20:54,760
Muichiro.

306
00:20:56,760 --> 00:20:58,760
Sorry I couldn't be more gentle with you.

307
00:20:58,760 --> 00:21:03,760
It's just, I could never afford to be that way.

308
00:21:04,760 --> 00:21:10,760
Being compassionate towards others is one more thing that only the chosen can do.

309
00:21:11,760 --> 00:21:22,760
But remember, Muichiro, no matter how virtuous a life you may lead, neither the gods nor Buddha will be the ones to protect you in the end.

310
00:21:22,760 --> 00:21:26,760
That's why I threw myself in front of you that day.

311
00:21:27,760 --> 00:21:31,760
Muichiro, you and I are nothing alike.

312
00:21:34,760 --> 00:21:41,760
Because for the sake of someone else, you can exert infinite strength.

313
00:21:41,760 --> 00:21:44,760
You are one of the chosen ones.

314
00:21:45,760 --> 00:21:48,760
You are one of the chosen ones.

