00:23:22,760 --> 00:23:23,380
Oh yeah!

320
00:23:23,700 --> 00:23:25,200
Happy birthday, Ms. Konroji.

321
00:23:25,700 --> 00:23:28,820
Let's start with your friends from the village.

322
00:23:29,300 --> 00:23:31,060
Our gifts and all-you-can-eat spread!

323
00:23:32,020 --> 00:23:35,360
All-you-can-eat means I can have as many helpings as I want, right?

324
00:23:35,480 --> 00:23:35,860
Huh?

325
00:23:36,080 --> 00:23:37,900
You're gonna have seconds of all this?

326
00:23:37,900 --> 00:23:40,700
Oh my gosh, oh my gosh, oh my gosh, oh my gosh, oh my gosh!

327
00:23:41,120 --> 00:23:43,280
Now it's time for a Taisho-era secret.

328
00:23:44,120 --> 00:23:50,400
Nowadays, Ms. Konroji's favorite foods are pork cutlets and omelet rice, which are both Western-style foods.

329
00:23:50,960 --> 00:23:54,740
So as a surprise, Nezuko and I got her some for her birthday!

330
00:23:54,740 --> 00:23:57,700
Thank you!

331
00:23:57,920 --> 00:23:59,020
Can I eat them now?

332
00:23:59,300 --> 00:24:00,100
Of course!

333
00:24:01,180 --> 00:24:05,460
Up next, Episode 9, Ms. Tashira, Muichiro Tokito.

334
00:24:05,700 --> 00:24:06,460
Seconds, please!

335
